  "batch_edn": "{\"source\" \":agent/codex\" \"forms\" [[:db/add \"82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4\" :answer/id #uuid \"82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4\"] [:db/add \"82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4\" :answer/value \"2\"] [:db/ensure \"82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\"] [:db/add \"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\" :answer-field/choices \"82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4\"] [:db/add \"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\" :answer-field/correct \"82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4\"] [:db/ensure \"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\" :question/id #uuid \"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\"] [:db/add \"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{12}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} 4 \\\\cot{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{12}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{12}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} 4 \\\\cot{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}} \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\csc{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6} \\\\right)}=2,\\\\quad \\\\csc{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=1$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- 2 \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}=\\\\left(-2\\\\right)-\\\\left(-4\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n2.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\" :question/answer-fields \"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\"] [:db/ensure \"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\"] [:db/add \"8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2\" :answer/id #uuid \"8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2\"] [:db/add \"8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\"] [:db/ensure \"8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\"] [:db/add \"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\" :answer-field/choices \"8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2\"] [:db/add \"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\" :answer-field/correct \"8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2\"] [:db/ensure \"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\" :question/id #uuid \"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\"] [:db/add \"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} 3 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} 3 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}} \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\cot{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\cot{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=0$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\frac{3 \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}=\\\\left(0\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\" :question/answer-fields \"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\"] [:db/ensure \"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\"] [:db/add \"afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6\" :answer/id #uuid \"afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6\"] [:db/add \"afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\sec{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}}{2}\"] [:db/ensure \"afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\"] [:db/add \"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\" :answer-field/choices \"afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6\"] [:db/add \"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\" :answer-field/correct \"afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6\"] [:db/ensure \"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\" :question/id #uuid \"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\"] [:db/add \"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\tan{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\tan{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3 \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3 \\\\sec{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\" :question/answer-fields \"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\"] [:db/ensure \"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\"] [:db/add \"c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e\" :answer/id #uuid \"c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e\"] [:db/add \"c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e\" :answer/value \"- \\\\csc{\\\\left(2 x + 3 \\\\right)}\"] [:db/ensure \"c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\"] [:db/add \"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\" :answer-field/choices \"c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e\"] [:db/add \"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\" :answer-field/correct \"c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e\"] [:db/ensure \"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\" :question/id #uuid \"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\"] [:db/add \"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cot{\\\\left(2 x + 3 \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(2 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x + 3$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cot{\\\\left(2 x + 3 \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(2 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\csc{\\\\left(2 x + 3 \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\" :question/answer-fields \"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\"] [:db/ensure \"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\"] [:db/add \"1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb\" :answer/id #uuid \"1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb\"] [:db/add \"1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb\" :answer/value \"2\"] [:db/ensure \"1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\"] [:db/add \"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\" :answer-field/choices \"1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb\"] [:db/add \"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\" :answer-field/correct \"1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb\"] [:db/ensure \"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\" :question/id #uuid \"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\"] [:db/add \"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}}^{0} 4 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\\\\\x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}}^{0} 4 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{0} \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\tan{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}=-1,\\\\quad \\\\tan{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[2 \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{0}=\\\\left(0\\\\right)-\\\\left(-2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n2.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\" :question/answer-fields \"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\"] [:db/ensure \"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\"] [:db/add \"78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2\" :answer/id #uuid \"78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2\"] [:db/add \"78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4 \\\\cot{\\\\left(3 x + 3 \\\\right)}}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\"] [:db/add \"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\" :answer-field/choices \"78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2\"] [:db/add \"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\" :answer-field/correct \"78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2\"] [:db/ensure \"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\" :question/id #uuid \"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\"] [:db/add \"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(3 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x + 3$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(3 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\frac{4 \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{4 \\\\cot{\\\\left(3 x + 3 \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\" :question/answer-fields \"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\"] [:db/ensure \"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\"] [:db/add \"0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310\" :answer/id #uuid \"0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310\"] [:db/add \"0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310\" :answer/value \"\\\\tan{\\\\left(4 x + 3 \\\\right)}\"] [:db/ensure \"0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\"] [:db/add \"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\" :answer-field/choices \"0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310\"] [:db/add \"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\" :answer-field/correct \"0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310\"] [:db/ensure \"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\" :question/id #uuid \"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\"] [:db/add \"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(4 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x + 3$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(4 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\tan{\\\\left(4 x + 3 \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\" :question/answer-fields \"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\"] [:db/ensure \"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\"] [:db/add \"ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd\" :answer/id #uuid \"ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd\"] [:db/add \"ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd\" :answer/value \"2\"] [:db/ensure \"ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\"] [:db/add \"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\" :answer-field/choices \"ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd\"] [:db/add \"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\" :answer-field/correct \"ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd\"] [:db/ensure \"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\" :question/id #uuid \"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\"] [:db/add \"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} 4 \\\\tan{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} 4 \\\\tan{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}} \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\sec{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\sec{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3} \\\\right)}=2$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[2 \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}}=\\\\left(4\\\\right)-\\\\left(2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n2.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\" :question/answer-fields \"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\"] [:db/ensure \"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\"] [:db/add \"3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140\" :answer/id #uuid \"3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140\"] [:db/add \"3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140\" :answer/value \"2\"] [:db/ensure \"3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\"] [:db/add \"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\" :answer-field/choices \"3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140\"] [:db/add \"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\" :answer-field/correct \"3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140\"] [:db/ensure \"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\" :question/id #uuid \"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\"] [:db/add \"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} 2 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} 2 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\tan{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\tan{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}=-1$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}=\\\\left(1\\\\right)-\\\\left(-1\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n2.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\" :question/answer-fields \"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\"] [:db/ensure \"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\"] [:db/add \"71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a\" :answer/id #uuid \"71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a\"] [:db/add \"71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\csc{\\\\left(3 - 4 x \\\\right)}}{2}\"] [:db/ensure \"71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\"] [:db/add \"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\" :answer-field/choices \"71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a\"] [:db/add \"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\" :answer-field/correct \"71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a\"] [:db/ensure \"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\" :question/id #uuid \"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\"] [:db/add \"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cot{\\\\left(3 - 4 x \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(3 - 4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 - 4 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cot{\\\\left(3 - 4 x \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(3 - 4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{\\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\csc{\\\\left(3 - 4 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\" :question/answer-fields \"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\"] [:db/ensure \"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\"] [:db/add \"cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68\" :answer/id #uuid \"cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68\"] [:db/add \"cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\"] [:db/ensure \"cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\"] [:db/add \"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\" :answer-field/choices \"cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68\"] [:db/add \"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\" :answer-field/correct \"cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68\"] [:db/ensure \"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\" :question/id #uuid \"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\"] [:db/add \"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} \\\\cot{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} \\\\cot{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\csc{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\csc{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6} \\\\right)}=2$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\frac{\\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}}=\\\\left(1\\\\right)-\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\" :question/answer-fields \"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\"] [:db/ensure \"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\"] [:db/add \"7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8\" :answer/id #uuid \"7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8\"] [:db/add \"7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8\" :answer/value \"2\"] [:db/ensure \"7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\"] [:db/add \"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\" :answer-field/choices \"7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8\"] [:db/add \"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\" :answer-field/correct \"7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8\"] [:db/ensure \"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\" :question/id #uuid \"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\"] [:db/add \"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}} 4 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}} 4 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-2\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\cot{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\cot{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}=1$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[2 \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}=\\\\left(2\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n2.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\" :question/answer-fields \"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\"] [:db/ensure \"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\"] [:db/add \"6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701\" :answer/id #uuid \"6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701\"] [:db/add \"6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701\" :answer/value \"\\\\cot{\\\\left(2 - 2 x \\\\right)}\"] [:db/ensure \"6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\"] [:db/add \"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\" :answer-field/choices \"6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701\"] [:db/add \"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\" :answer-field/correct \"6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701\"] [:db/ensure \"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\" :question/id #uuid \"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\"] [:db/add \"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(2 - 2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 - 2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(2 - 2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\cot{\\\\left(2 - 2 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\" :question/answer-fields \"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\"] [:db/ensure \"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\"] [:db/add \"7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516\" :answer/id #uuid \"7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516\"] [:db/add \"7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516\" :answer/value \"- \\\\tan{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}\"] [:db/ensure \"7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\"] [:db/add \"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\" :answer-field/choices \"7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516\"] [:db/add \"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\" :answer-field/correct \"7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516\"] [:db/ensure \"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\" :question/id #uuid \"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\"] [:db/add \"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 - 3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\tan{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\" :question/answer-fields \"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\"] [:db/ensure \"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\"] [:db/add \"9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1\" :answer/id #uuid \"9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1\"] [:db/add \"9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1\" :answer/value \"-1\"] [:db/ensure \"9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\"] [:db/add \"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\" :answer-field/choices \"9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1\"] [:db/add \"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\" :answer-field/correct \"9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1\"] [:db/ensure \"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\" :question/id #uuid \"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\"] [:db/add \"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} 2 \\\\tan{\\\\left(- 2 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(- 2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} 2 \\\\tan{\\\\left(- 2 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(- 2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}} \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\sec{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\sec{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3} \\\\right)}=2$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}}=\\\\left(-2\\\\right)-\\\\left(-1\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n-1.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\" :question/answer-fields \"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\"] [:db/ensure \"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\"] [:db/add \"1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b\" :answer/id #uuid \"1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b\"] [:db/add \"1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b\" :answer/value \"- \\\\sec{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}\"] [:db/ensure \"1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\"] [:db/add \"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\" :answer-field/choices \"1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b\"] [:db/add \"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\" :answer-field/correct \"1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b\"] [:db/ensure \"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\" :question/id #uuid \"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\"] [:db/add \"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\tan{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 - 3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\tan{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\sec{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\" :question/answer-fields \"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\"] [:db/ensure \"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/id #uuid \"53bcc68c-e1cf-5367-863f-11b94bb43f98\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/script \"generators/f7/f7df24fd3ca672eb8b9fc8d988ba58fa431febfd5ca41d8bb30c7dfd3751ed9a/generator.py\"] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/question-generator \"generator\"] [:db/ensure 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/validate]] \"assertions\" [[\"82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4\" :answer/id #uuid \"82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4\"] [\"82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4\" :answer/value \"2\"] [\"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\"] [\"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\" :answer-field/choices \"82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4\"] [\"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\" :answer-field/correct \"82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4\"] [\"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\" :question/id #uuid \"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\"] [\"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{12}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} 4 \\\\cot{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{12}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{12}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} 4 \\\\cot{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}} \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\csc{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6} \\\\right)}=2,\\\\quad \\\\csc{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=1$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- 2 \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}=\\\\left(-2\\\\right)-\\\\left(-4\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n2.\\n$$\"] [\"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\" :question/answer-fields \"1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330\"] [\"8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2\" :answer/id #uuid \"8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2\"] [\"8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\"] [\"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\"] [\"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\" :answer-field/choices \"8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2\"] [\"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\" :answer-field/correct \"8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2\"] [\"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\" :question/id #uuid \"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\"] [\"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} 3 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} 3 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}} \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\cot{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\cot{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=0$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\frac{3 \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}=\\\\left(0\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}.\\n$$\"] [\"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\" :question/answer-fields \"d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3\"] [\"afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6\" :answer/id #uuid \"afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6\"] [\"afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\sec{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}}{2}\"] [\"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\"] [\"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\" :answer-field/choices \"afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6\"] [\"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\" :answer-field/correct \"afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6\"] [\"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\" :question/id #uuid \"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\"] [\"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\tan{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\tan{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3 \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3 \\\\sec{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\" :question/answer-fields \"47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5\"] [\"c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e\" :answer/id #uuid \"c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e\"] [\"c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e\" :answer/value \"- \\\\csc{\\\\left(2 x + 3 \\\\right)}\"] [\"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\"] [\"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\" :answer-field/choices \"c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e\"] [\"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\" :answer-field/correct \"c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e\"] [\"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\" :question/id #uuid \"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\"] [\"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cot{\\\\left(2 x + 3 \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(2 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x + 3$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cot{\\\\left(2 x + 3 \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(2 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\csc{\\\\left(2 x + 3 \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\" :question/answer-fields \"64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2\"] [\"1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb\" :answer/id #uuid \"1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb\"] [\"1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb\" :answer/value \"2\"] [\"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\"] [\"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\" :answer-field/choices \"1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb\"] [\"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\" :answer-field/correct \"1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb\"] [\"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\" :question/id #uuid \"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\"] [\"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}}^{0} 4 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\\\\\x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}}^{0} 4 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{0} \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\tan{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}=-1,\\\\quad \\\\tan{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[2 \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{0}=\\\\left(0\\\\right)-\\\\left(-2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n2.\\n$$\"] [\"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\" :question/answer-fields \"c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782\"] [\"78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2\" :answer/id #uuid \"78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2\"] [\"78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4 \\\\cot{\\\\left(3 x + 3 \\\\right)}}{3}\"] [\"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\"] [\"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\" :answer-field/choices \"78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2\"] [\"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\" :answer-field/correct \"78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2\"] [\"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\" :question/id #uuid \"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\"] [\"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(3 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x + 3$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(3 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\frac{4 \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{4 \\\\cot{\\\\left(3 x + 3 \\\\right)}}{3}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\" :question/answer-fields \"bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c\"] [\"0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310\" :answer/id #uuid \"0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310\"] [\"0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310\" :answer/value \"\\\\tan{\\\\left(4 x + 3 \\\\right)}\"] [\"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\"] [\"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\" :answer-field/choices \"0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310\"] [\"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\" :answer-field/correct \"0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310\"] [\"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\" :question/id #uuid \"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\"] [\"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(4 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x + 3$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(4 x + 3 \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\tan{\\\\left(4 x + 3 \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\" :question/answer-fields \"6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef\"] [\"ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd\" :answer/id #uuid \"ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd\"] [\"ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd\" :answer/value \"2\"] [\"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\"] [\"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\" :answer-field/choices \"ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd\"] [\"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\" :answer-field/correct \"ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd\"] [\"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\" :question/id #uuid \"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\"] [\"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} 4 \\\\tan{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} 4 \\\\tan{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}} \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\sec{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\sec{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3} \\\\right)}=2$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[2 \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}}=\\\\left(4\\\\right)-\\\\left(2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n2.\\n$$\"] [\"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\" :question/answer-fields \"0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda\"] [\"3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140\" :answer/id #uuid \"3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140\"] [\"3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140\" :answer/value \"2\"] [\"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\"] [\"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\" :answer-field/choices \"3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140\"] [\"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\" :answer-field/correct \"3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140\"] [\"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\" :question/id #uuid \"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\"] [\"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} 2 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} 2 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\tan{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\tan{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}=-1$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}^{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}=\\\\left(1\\\\right)-\\\\left(-1\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n2.\\n$$\"] [\"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\" :question/answer-fields \"48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d\"] [\"71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a\" :answer/id #uuid \"71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a\"] [\"71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\csc{\\\\left(3 - 4 x \\\\right)}}{2}\"] [\"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\"] [\"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\" :answer-field/choices \"71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a\"] [\"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\" :answer-field/correct \"71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a\"] [\"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\" :question/id #uuid \"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\"] [\"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cot{\\\\left(3 - 4 x \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(3 - 4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 - 4 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cot{\\\\left(3 - 4 x \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(3 - 4 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{\\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\csc{\\\\left(3 - 4 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\" :question/answer-fields \"cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497\"] [\"cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68\" :answer/id #uuid \"cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68\"] [\"cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\"] [\"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\"] [\"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\" :answer-field/choices \"cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68\"] [\"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\" :answer-field/correct \"cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68\"] [\"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\" :question/id #uuid \"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\"] [\"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} \\\\cot{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} \\\\cot{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\csc{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\csc{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6} \\\\right)}=2$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\frac{\\\\csc{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}}=\\\\left(1\\\\right)-\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}.\\n$$\"] [\"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\" :question/answer-fields \"d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979\"] [\"7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8\" :answer/id #uuid \"7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8\"] [\"7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8\" :answer/value \"2\"] [\"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\"] [\"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\" :answer-field/choices \"7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8\"] [\"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\" :answer-field/correct \"7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8\"] [\"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\" :question/id #uuid \"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\"] [\"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}} 4 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}} 4 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(- 2 x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-2\\\\left(\\\\int_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}} \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\cot{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\cot{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4} \\\\right)}=1$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[2 \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}}=\\\\left(2\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n2.\\n$$\"] [\"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\" :question/answer-fields \"81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0\"] [\"6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701\" :answer/id #uuid \"6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701\"] [\"6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701\" :answer/value \"\\\\cot{\\\\left(2 - 2 x \\\\right)}\"] [\"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\"] [\"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\" :answer-field/choices \"6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701\"] [\"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\" :answer-field/correct \"6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701\"] [\"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\" :question/id #uuid \"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\"] [\"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(2 - 2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 - 2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(2 - 2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=- \\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\csc^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\cot{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\cot{\\\\left(2 - 2 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\" :question/answer-fields \"555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a\"] [\"7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516\" :answer/id #uuid \"7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516\"] [\"7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516\" :answer/value \"- \\\\tan{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}\"] [\"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\"] [\"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\" :answer-field/choices \"7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516\"] [\"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\" :answer-field/correct \"7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516\"] [\"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\" :question/id #uuid \"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\"] [\"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 - 3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sec^{2}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\tan{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\" :question/answer-fields \"c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74\"] [\"9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1\" :answer/id #uuid \"9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1\"] [\"9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1\" :answer/value \"-1\"] [\"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\"] [\"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\" :answer-field/choices \"9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1\"] [\"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\" :answer-field/correct \"9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1\"] [\"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\" :question/id #uuid \"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\"] [\"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} 2 \\\\tan{\\\\left(- 2 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(- 2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\\n$$\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}} 2 \\\\tan{\\\\left(- 2 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(- 2 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}} \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\sec{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=1,\\\\quad \\\\sec{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3} \\\\right)}=2$.\\n\\nIntegrate and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[- \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}}=\\\\left(-2\\\\right)-\\\\left(-1\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe answer is\\n\\n$$\\n-1.\\n$$\"] [\"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\" :question/answer-fields \"4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894\"] [\"1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b\" :answer/id #uuid \"1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b\"] [\"1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b\" :answer/value \"- \\\\sec{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}\"] [\"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\"] [\"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\" :answer-field/choices \"1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b\"] [\"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\" :answer-field/correct \"1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b\"] [\"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\" :question/id #uuid \"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\"] [\"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\tan{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 - 3 x$. Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\tan{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\\n\\n$$\\n-\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\tan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)} \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=- \\\\sec{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n- \\\\sec{\\\\left(3 - 3 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\" :question/answer-fields \"c2db328e-939b-5462-8b10-1e131904ef3d\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions \"c96f8fe3-5339-56e7-8891-cbbaa496c143\"] [\"generator\" :question-generator/id #uuid \"53bcc68c-e1cf-5367-863f-11b94bb43f98\"] [\"generator\" :question-generator/script \"generators/f7/f7df24fd3ca672eb8b9fc8d988ba58fa431febfd5ca41d8bb30c7dfd3751ed9a/generator.py\"] [17592186068916 :knowledge-point/question-generator \"generator\"]] \"retractions\" [[17592186068916 :knowledge-point/question-generator 17592186678238]]}",
